  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evidence matters-Dissemination Seminar
Evaluation of the EU support to Sustainable Agri-Food Systems in partner countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;In late 2021, DG INTPA initiated an evaluation of the European Union support to Sustainable Agri-Food Systems. The general objective of this evaluation is to provide the relevant external cooperation services of the EU with an independent assessment of the EU&apos;s past and current support. With a main focus on learning from the past, this evaluation seeks to be a stock-taking and forward-looking exercise.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In order to disseminate and use the findings, lessons learnt and good practices of this evaluation, a dissemination seminar is organized at the end of the evaluation. This seminar will be organised for stakeholders from the EC but will also be of great interest for the wider development community, partner countries and implementing partners.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
